{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Dexterity 15 or higher\n\nYou have become very hard to hit due to the training of your reflexes and speed. You have the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- When a creature would move within 5 feet of you, as a reaction you may dodge out of the way, moving 10 feet into an unoccupied space. Movement done this way does not trigger opportunity attacks.\n\n- As a bonus action, you may take the Dodge action. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you can not use it again until you finish a long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Customa4e6a30c-4ca5-4955-ba1b-a5fdbd3f5058","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Agile Evader [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}